# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dynamic linker: the first call into a lazily-bound library entry point goes
# through _dl_runtime_resolve, whose register save/restore of the caller's (tainted) argument registers is a
# well-known memcheck false positive. Leaf-only anchor, deliberately: the unwinder often cannot walk past the
# trampoline (the caller frame records as 0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF), so a caller-anchored entry does not match reliably,
# and the trampoline is pure dynamic-linker machinery - no application branch can hide under this leaf.
{
   ct-quat: lazy PLT binding (register save/restore false positive)
   Memcheck:Value8
   fun:_dl_runtime_resolve
}
